<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31417" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσ-κρίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ρῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enrol, admit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοὺς ἐφήβους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					477.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cause to enter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					3.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.432
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀυείρους μερόπεσσιν</span>
			Orac. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>App.Anth.</u>
				6.197
			</span></i>: but more freq., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>enter into, penetrate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.604
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				15.6.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be adjudged,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.578
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leo Phil.
			</span></i>).</div>
